      "code": "m_NextLayer = new GREv0Layer(payload, payloadLen, this, m_Packet);",
      "note": "The staged packet reaches the vulnerable GRE parser path because the IPv4 protocol byte is 47 and `GreLayer::getGREVersion(payload, payloadLen)` classifies the payload as GREv0 instead of generic payload.",
