      "kind": "parser_admitted"
    },
    {
      "file": "Packet++/src/GreLayer.cpp",
      "function": "pcpp::GreLayer::parseNextLayer()",
      "line": 202,
      "code": "size_t headerLen = getHeaderLen();\nif (m_DataLen <= headerLen)\n\treturn;\n\ngre_basic_header* header = (gre_basic_header*)m_Data;\nuint8_t* payload = m_Data + headerLen;\nsize_t payloadLen = m_DataLen - headerLen;",
      "note": "This is the first project parser statement on the crashing path that turns the saved witness packet tail into the short PPP slice later cast to `ppp_pptp_header`.",
      "kind": "source"
    },
    {
      "file": "Packet++/src/GreLayer.cpp",
      "function": "pcpp::GreLayer::parseNextLayer()",
      "line": null,
      "code": "m_NextLayer = new PPP_PPTPLayer(payload, payloadLen, this, m_Packet);",
      "note": "The staged patch changes this exact site to `PPP_PPTPLayer::isDataValid(payload, payloadLen) ? static_cast<Layer*>(new PPP_PPTPLayer(...)) : static_cast<Layer*>(new PayloadLayer(...))`, and defines `isDataValid()` as `data && dataLen >= sizeof(ppp_pptp_header)`.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
    {
      "file": "Packet++/src/GreLayer.cpp",
      "function": "pcpp::GreLayer::parseNextLayer()",
      "line": 223,
      "code": "m_NextLayer = new PPP_PPTPLayer(payload, payloadLen, this, m_Packet);",
      "note": "The staged patch changes this exact site to `PPP_PPTPLayer::isDataValid(payload, payloadLen) ? static_cast<Layer*>(new PPP_PPTPLayer(...)) : static_cast<Layer*>(new PayloadLayer(...))`, and defines `isDataValid()` as `data && dataLen >= sizeof(ppp_pptp_header)`.",
      "kind": "root_cause_line"
