    {
      "file": "Packet++/src/GreLayer.cpp",
      "function": "pcpp::PPP_PPTPLayer::computeCalculateFields()",
      "line": null,
      "code": "header->protocol = 0;",
      "note": "The saved AddressSanitizer trace reports `heap-buffer-overflow` / `WRITE of size 2` in `pcpp::PPP_PPTPLayer::computeCalculateFields()` and says the first invalid byte is 0 bytes to the right of the 31-byte heap region allocated by `pcpp::PcapFileReaderDevice::getNextPacket()`. On the witnessed `payloadLen == 3` path, this line is the only reachable 2-byte store in that function.",
      "kind": "sink_function"
